Buying or leasing a vehicle should provide reliable transportation and confidence on the road. Persistent mechanical or safety problems can disrupt that expectation and create significant financial concerns. California’s Lemon Law provides legal protections for qualifying vehicles covered by a manufacturer’s warranty. A [Lemon Law Lawyer](/) can review the circumstances surrounding repeated repairs and determine whether a claim may qualify under California law.

